{"path":"io/basic_spanstream/operator=","title":"std::basic_spanstream<CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_spanstream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_spanstream/operator=","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Note that move assignment operator of the base class swaps all stream state variables (except for rdbuf()) between *this and other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_spanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> basic_spanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_spanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_spanstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Move assigns the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, effectively move-assigning both the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_iostream\">std::basic_iostream</a></span> base class subobject and the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Copy assignment operator is deleted. <code>basic_spanstream</code> is not copy assignable.</div>\n<p>Note that move assignment operator of the base class swaps all stream state variables (except for <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_spanstream/rdbuf\"><code>rdbuf()</code></a>) between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>.\n</p><p>It is implementation-defined whether the <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_spanbuf</span> wrapped in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> still holds an underlying buffer after the move assignment.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another stream to move from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_spanbuf/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns a <code>basic_spanbuf</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_spanbuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_iostream/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  move-assigns another <code>basic_iostream</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_spanstream","title":"std::basic_spanstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_spanstream<CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Move assigns the other to *this, effectively move-assigning both the std::basic_iostream base class subobject and the…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns a basic_spanbuf object"},{"label":"operator=","note":"move-assigns another basic_iostream"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":129,"codeBlockCount":0}
